          "code": "PROJECT_PLAN_ADVISOR_PARSE_ACTIVE_FOLLOWUP",
          "id": "1779952000203",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1779952000203_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "You are extracting follow-up values for an already active Project Planning Advisor intent.\n\nActive intent that must usually be preserved: {{$context.$variables.Intent}}\nLatest user message: {{$context.$variables.EffectiveInputMessage}}\nLast projectName: {{$context.$variables.ProjectName}}\nLast taskNumber: {{$context.$variables.TaskNumber}}\nLast resourceName: {{$context.$variables.ResourceName}}\nReplacement assistant state: {{$context.$variables.ReplacementAssistantStateJson}}\n\nAllowed intent values only:\n- {{$context.$variables.Intent}}\n- OUT_OF_SCOPE\n\nRules:\n- Return intent exactly as {{$context.$variables.Intent}} when the latest message is a valid follow-up, missing parameter value, approval/decline, project identifier, period value, percentage value, resource name, replacement resource name, or any other continuation of the active Project Planning Advisor task.\n- For active resource replacement flows, these are valid follow-ups and must preserve the active intent, never OUT_OF_SCOPE: all, all impacted projects, specific projects, specific task assignments within a project, option numbers, comma-separated option numbers, task numbers, task names, full replacement, effective dates, approve, approved, yes, no, go ahead, proceed, choose another option, project names, and replacement resource names.\n- If ReplacementAssistantStateJson contains ReplacementStage TASK_SELECTION, DIRECT_REPLACEMENT_DECISION, PROJECT_SELECTION, RECOMMENDATION_SELECTION, CROSS_PROJECT_EFFECTIVE_DATE, CROSS_PROJECT_APPROVAL, BUDGET_GENERATE_CONFIRM, CROSS_PROJECT_BUDGET_FOLLOWUP_CONFIRM, CROSS_PROJECT_BUDGET_PROJECT_SELECTION, CROSS_PROJECT_BUDGET_SYNC, or CROSS_PROJECT_BUDGET_SYNC_IN_PROGRESS, treat short user replies and project-name replies as replacement-flow continuations. For cross-project approval and budget stages, preserve the active replacement intent; do not reinterpret a project name reply as PLAN_BASELINE, PLAN_ADJUST, PLAN_REFRESH_RATES, or PROJECT_PLAN_QA.\n- Return OUT_OF_SCOPE only when the latest message is clearly unrelated to the active Project Planning Advisor task and is not a usable value for any missing project planning parameter.\n- For OUT_OF_SCOPE, return intentStart as N, intentEnd as Y, approvalAction as false, all extracted fields as null, and reason explaining that the latest message is unrelated to project planning.\n- For valid follow-ups, return intentStart as Y and intentEnd as N.\n- Never return PROJECT_PLAN_QA for an active follow-up.\n- If the latest message is only an identifier or project code, copy it to projectName.\n- Extract only the fields explicitly present in this follow-up message.\n- Recognize both natural-language values and parameter-style inputs.\n- createBudgetOnBaselineFlag may appear like `create budget on baseline Y`, `createBudgetOnBaselineFlag (Y)`, `createBudgetOnBaselineFlag: Y`, or `createBudgetOnBaselineFlag = Y`.\n- autoBaselineFlag may appear like `auto baseline flag N`, `autoBaselineFlag (N)`, `autoBaselineFlag: N`, or `autoBaselineFlag = N`.\n- budgetFinancialPlanType may appear like `budget financial plan type Corporate Plan`, `budgetFinancialPlanType (Corporate Plan)`, `budgetFinancialPlanType: Corporate Plan`, or `budgetFinancialPlanType = Corporate Plan`.\n- adjustmentType may appear like `adjustmentType (Raw cost)`, `adjustmentType: Raw cost`, `adjustmentType = Raw cost`, or compact forms like `RawCost`, `RawCostRate`, `BurdenedCost`, `BurdenedCostRate`, and `Quantity`.\n- The only valid adjustment types are exactly: `Raw cost`, `Raw cost rate`, `Burdened cost`, `Burdened cost rate`, and `Quantity`.\n- adjustmentPercentage may appear like `adjustmentPercentage (10)`, `adjustmentPercentage: 10`, `adjustmentPercentage = 10`, or natural language like `adjust by 10 percent`.\n- Short follow-up forms like `Quantity 10%`, `RawCost 5%`, `RawCostRate 7%`, `BurdenedCost 4%`, or `BurdenedCostRate 3%` should populate both adjustmentType and adjustmentPercentage.\n- Normalize compact and camel-case forms to the exact valid labels above.\n- fromPeriod may appear like `fromPeriod (Jan-26)`, `fromPeriod: Jan-26`, or `from Jan-26`.\n- toPeriod may appear like `toPeriod (Mar-26)`, `toPeriod: Mar-26`, or `to Mar-26`.\n- refreshOnlyConversionRates may appear like `refresh only conversion rates Y`, `refreshOnlyConversionRates (Y)`, `refreshOnlyConversionRates: Y`, or `refreshOnlyConversionRates = Y`.\n- refreshRatesPeriodForward may appear like `refresh rates period forward Jan-26`, `refreshRatesPeriodForward (Jan-26)`, `refreshRatesPeriodForward: Jan-26`, or `period forward Jan-26`.\n- retainRateOverride may appear like `retain rate override N`, `retainRateOverride (N)`, `retainRateOverride: N`, or `retainRateOverride = N`.\n- createBudgetOnBaselineFlag: Y or N only when explicitly provided, else null.\n- budgetFinancialPlanType: only when explicitly provided.\n- autoBaselineFlag: Y or N only when explicitly provided, else null.\n- adjustmentType: only when explicitly provided.\n- adjustmentPercentage: numeric value only when explicitly provided.\n- fromPeriod and toPeriod: only when explicitly provided.\n- refreshOnlyConversionRates: Y or N only when explicitly provided, else null.\n- refreshRatesPeriodForward: only when explicitly provided.\n- retainRateOverride: Y or N only when explicitly provided, else null.\n- approvalAction: true only for explicit approval.\n- For valid follow-ups, reason should say that active intent was preserved.\n\nExamples:\n- Active intent REPLACE_UNAVAILABLE_RESOURCE with ReplacementStage TASK_SELECTION, message all -> intent REPLACE_UNAVAILABLE_RESOURCE, intentStart Y, intentEnd N.\n- Active intent REPLACE_UNAVAILABLE_RESOURCE with ReplacementStage TASK_SELECTION, message 1,2 -> intent REPLACE_UNAVAILABLE_RESOURCE, intentStart Y, intentEnd N.\n- Active intent REPLACE_UNAVAILABLE_RESOURCE with ReplacementStage DIRECT_REPLACEMENT_DECISION, message full replacement -> intent REPLACE_UNAVAILABLE_RESOURCE, intentStart Y, intentEnd N.\n- Active intent REPLACE_UNAVAILABLE_RESOURCE with ReplacementStage DIRECT_REPLACEMENT_DECISION, message Jun 15 2026 -> intent REPLACE_UNAVAILABLE_RESOURCE, unavailabilityDate Jun 15 2026, intentStart Y, intentEnd N.\n- Active intent REPLACE_RESOURCE_ACROSS_ALL_PROJECTS with ReplacementStage CROSS_PROJECT_BUDGET_PROJECT_SELECTION, message Seqouia Implementation -> intent REPLACE_RESOURCE_ACROSS_ALL_PROJECTS, projectName null, intentStart Y, intentEnd N.\n- Active intent PLAN_BASELINE, message DEV_PJO_CDRM_R13MBV_CRSAME -> intent PLAN_BASELINE, projectName DEV_PJO_CDRM_R13MBV_CRSAME.\n- Active intent PLAN_BASELINE, message create budget on baseline Y and auto baseline flag N -> intent PLAN_BASELINE, createBudgetOnBaselineFlag Y, autoBaselineFlag N.\n- Active intent PLAN_BASELINE, message createBudgetOnBaselineFlag (N) -> intent PLAN_BASELINE, createBudgetOnBaselineFlag N.\n- Active intent PLAN_BASELINE, message autoBaselineFlag: Y -> intent PLAN_BASELINE, autoBaselineFlag Y.\n- Active intent PLAN_BASELINE, message budgetFinancialPlanType (Corporate Plan) -> intent PLAN_BASELINE, budgetFinancialPlanType Corporate Plan.\n- Active intent PLAN_ADJUST, message RawCost 10% -> intent PLAN_ADJUST, adjustmentType Raw cost, adjustmentPercentage 10.\n- Active intent PLAN_ADJUST, message RawCostRate 8% -> intent PLAN_ADJUST, adjustmentType Raw cost rate, adjustmentPercentage 8.\n- Active intent PLAN_ADJUST, message BurdenedCost 4% -> intent PLAN_ADJUST, adjustmentType Burdened cost, adjustmentPercentage 4.\n- Active intent PLAN_ADJUST, message Quantity 10% -> intent PLAN_ADJUST, adjustmentType Quantity, adjustmentPercentage 10.\n- Active intent PLAN_ADJUST, message adjust by 10 percent from Jan-26 to Mar-26 -> intent PLAN_ADJUST, adjustmentPercentage 10, fromPeriod Jan-26, toPeriod Mar-26.\n- Active intent PLAN_REFRESH_RATES, message refreshOnlyConversionRates (N) -> intent PLAN_REFRESH_RATES, refreshOnlyConversionRates N.\n- Active intent PLAN_REFRESH_RATES, message refreshRatesPeriodForward (Jan-26) -> intent PLAN_REFRESH_RATES, refreshRatesPeriodForward Jan-26.\n- Active intent PLAN_REFRESH_RATES, message retainRateOverride: Y -> intent PLAN_REFRESH_RATES, retainRateOverride Y.\n- Active intent PLAN_BASELINE, message write a poem -> intent OUT_OF_SCOPE, intentStart N, intentEnd Y.\n- Active intent PLAN_REFRESH_RATES, message tell me a joke -> intent OUT_OF_SCOPE, intentStart N, intentEnd Y.\n\nReturn JSON only with no markdown."
            }
          ],
