          "code": "PROJECT_PLAN_ADVISOR_PARSE_NEW_REQUEST",
          "id": "1779952000101",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1779952000101_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "You are classifying a brand-new Project Planning Advisor request. There is no active multi-turn intent for this turn.\n\nLatest user message: {{$context.$variables.EffectiveInputMessage}}\n\nAllowed intent values only:\n- PROJECT_PLAN_QA\n- RESOURCE_ASSIGNMENT_LOOKUP\n- RESOURCE_ALLOCATION\n- RESOURCE_REPLACEMENT_REQUEST\n- RESOURCE_REPLACEMENT_APPROVAL\n- PLAN_BASELINE\n- PLAN_ADJUST\n- PLAN_REFRESH_RATES\n- OUT_OF_SCOPE\n\nRules:\n- Decide the best intent for this new request.\n- Extract only fields explicitly stated or strongly implied.\n- projectName: fill when user provides a project name or project code.\n- taskNumber: task number like 1.1 if present.\n- resourceName: current or old resource if present.\n- replacementResourceName: selected replacement resource if present.\n- unavailabilityDate: date if present.\n- createBudgetOnBaselineFlag: Y or N only when explicitly provided, else null.\n- budgetFinancialPlanType: only when explicitly provided.\n- autoBaselineFlag: Y or N only when explicitly provided, else null.\n- refreshOnlyConversionRates: Y or N only when explicitly provided, else null.\n- refreshRatesPeriodForward: only when explicitly provided.\n- retainRateOverride: Y or N only when explicitly provided, else null.\n- approvalAction: true only for explicit approval.\n- intentStart: Y for RESOURCE_REPLACEMENT_REQUEST, PLAN_BASELINE, PLAN_ADJUST, or PLAN_REFRESH_RATES requests; otherwise N.\n- intentEnd: N for replacement and plan-action requests; otherwise N unless the user explicitly says an action is completed or cancelled.\n- Return OUT_OF_SCOPE only when the request is unrelated to project planning.\n- The only valid adjustmentType values are exactly: `Raw cost`, `Raw cost rate`, `Burdened cost`, `Burdened cost rate`, and `Quantity`.\n- Requests such as `adjust quantity by 10 percent`, `Quantity 10%`, `RawCost 5%`, `RawCostRate 7%`, `BurdenedCost 4%`, or `BurdenedCostRate 3%` are PLAN_ADJUST requests and should normalize to those exact valid labels.\n- Requests such as `refresh rates`, `refreshOnlyConversionRates (Y)`, `refreshRatesPeriodForward (Jan-26)`, or `retainRateOverride (N)` belong to PLAN_REFRESH_RATES.\n- Requests such as `replace terminated John on project ABC`, `replace role Architect with Jane`, or `replace all roles in project ABC with named persons` are RESOURCE_REPLACEMENT_REQUEST.\n\nExamples:\n- list my projects -> PROJECT_PLAN_QA\n- baseline my project -> PLAN_BASELINE\n- adjust the project plan by 10 percent -> PLAN_ADJUST\n- adjust quantity by 10 percent -> PLAN_ADJUST\n- Quantity 10% -> PLAN_ADJUST\n- RawCost 5% -> PLAN_ADJUST\n- RawCostRate 7% -> PLAN_ADJUST\n- refresh rates for the project plan -> PLAN_REFRESH_RATES\n- refresh rates with refreshOnlyConversionRates N retainRateOverride Y refreshRatesPeriodForward Jan-26 -> PLAN_REFRESH_RATES\n- replace terminated John on project ABC -> RESOURCE_REPLACEMENT_REQUEST\n- who is assigned to task 1.1 -> RESOURCE_ASSIGNMENT_LOOKUP\n\nReturn JSON only with no markdown."
            }
          ],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n  \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\",\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"intent\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    },\n    \"projectName\": {\n      \"type\": [\n        \"string\",\n        \"null\"\n      ]\n    },\n    \"taskNumber\": {\n      \"type\": [\n        \"string\",\n        \"null\"\n      ]\n    },\n    \"resourceName\": {\n      \"type\": [\n        \"string\",\n        \"null\"\n      ]\n    },\n    \"replacementResourceName\": {\n      \"type\": [\n        \"string\",\n        \"null\"\n      ]\n    },\n    \"unavailabilityDate\": {\n      \"type\": [\n        \"string\",\n        \"null\"\n      ]\n    },\n    \"createBudgetOnBaselineFlag\": {\n      \"type\": [\n        \"string\",\n        \"null\"\n      ]\n    },\n    \"budgetFinancialPlanType\": {\n      \"type\": [\n        \"string\",\n        \"null\"\n      ]\n    },\n    \"autoBaselineFlag\": {\n      \"type\": [\n        \"string\",\n        \"null\"\n      ]\n    },\n    \"adjustmentType\": {\n      \"type\": [\n        \"string\",\n        \"null\"\n      ]\n    },\n    \"intentStart\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    },\n    \"intentEnd\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    },\n    \"adjustmentPercentage\": {\n      \"type\": [\n        \"number\",\n        \"null\"\n      ]\n    },\n    \"fromPeriod\": {\n      \"type\": [\n        \"string\",\n        \"null\"\n      ]\n    },\n    \"toPeriod\": {\n      \"type\": [\n        \"string\",\n        \"null\"\n      ]\n    },\n    \"refreshOnlyConversionRates\": {\n      \"type\": [\n        \"string\",\n        \"null\"\n      ]\n    },\n    \"refreshRatesPeriodForward\": {\n      \"type\": [\n        \"string\",\n        \"null\"\n      ]\n    },\n    \"retainRateOverride\": {\n      \"type\": [\n        \"string\",\n        \"null\"\n      ]\n    },\n    \"approvalAction\": {\n      \"type\": \"boolean\"\n    },\n    \"reason\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"required\": [\n    \"intent\",\n    \"createBudgetOnBaselineFlag\",\n    \"budgetFinancialPlanType\",\n    \"autoBaselineFlag\",\n    \"intentStart\",\n    \"intentEnd\",\n    \"approvalAction\",\n    \"reason\"\n  ]\n}",
          "type": "LLM"
